//CTP Editor Structure file
//For more detailed comments see advance.ces

0.3 //Version number

#%047%047	//Comment charachter in data file
%032%009	//Delimiter charachters in data file
		// (use %nnn for ASCII ref)
:		//Break on right quasi-delimiter
}{		//Break on left quasi-delimiter

1 //Format

f //Whether this has a number at the top (num of entries)
f //Whether this has a tree structure
f //Whether this file references GL entries
f //Whether this file has entries in gl_str.txt
f //Whether this file is the GL icon file
f //Whether this structure file describes formatting of fields
  // (i.e. whether it has the LBF and LAF columns below)

//Name			Comp	PByDef	AMult	NumArgs
	//Type		DefaultValue	Comment
Age			t	t	f	1
	0		1		Age number
StartingRound		t	t	f	1
	0		0		Base turn number that this age can be entered
NeedAdvances		t	t	f	1
	0		0		Number of advances from this age that must be known to trigger this age
SlicObject		t	t	f	1
	0		"Age1Entered"	SlicObject of the message to display when age is entered. Must be a valid SlicObject from Script.slc
@ //End of fields

